# Undergrowth Recon: "target land card from your graveyard" (CR 115.1, 108.3). Turn 2 Bot2 Thought Scours itself, milling two Islands
# into Bot2's graveyard; on turn 3 Bot1's own Thought Scour mills a Forest and a Lightning Bolt. At Bot1's upkeep on turn 5 the only
# legal target is Bot1's Forest, chosen without asking: it returns tapped, and the Islands stay in Bot2's graveyard.
# (Bot2 also discards a Swamp to its hand size at turn 4's cleanup.)

